{"skill":{"slug":"zoho-bigin","displayName":"zoho-bigin"},"version":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790941258479,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":55118,"sha256":"977b9a18842deb5573d27cbea19ae99956529318f43845918ad8ead1dff510e6","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/calendly/triggers.md","size":10281,"sha256":"ae92dbfb6dd4caf628900b293d1b3c6e7d5e70cf7f6a9397407594daf50d4a48","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/github/triggers.md","size":61142,"sha256":"7424d3be38ec400eb8a4b0a6a94a94eeec40208c0bcee29a61caa5da48eea7f4","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/google-mail/triggers.md","size":2648,"sha256":"5cc5065cd7db33dc33715675bbb0ee29ed49657ad9ad4354aebd1a9efdf8d8f3","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/hubspot/triggers.md","size":8298,"sha256":"439d56e4d02e119e1de3caf79a0334243ae70c583a3e15847831c396f39c2837","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/linear/triggers.md","size":7270,"sha256":"641f6496f50e09faab921ef4c06f725122b798cb034e9f0dfaf9f838074ab377","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/notion/triggers.md","size":5840,"sha256":"fdaf3840d8213dbd7549426c1166f94cc94b09e022a1611ef2dad6f36db2f969","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/slack/triggers.md","size":6181,"sha256":"b5ee099a215223a7e5186c41a0d13fc1de68e977719304c509df105843d81f38","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/stripe/triggers.md","size":25651,"sha256":"ae091545396a376c7ecfe09e94b46b7bbb44fd8a72ea954bcc1239052b7959f0","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/time/triggers.md","size":1140,"sha256":"b8f5a523501f8d03e11e58f6426cd96b54ba0c66c8983b57c0ea31386b309e01","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2147,"sha256":"8d13c3f60909d207a8f40d18181ba86d2b49d8278d04a88b3ef32b549b3b1c41","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1790942451517,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"7cc5a16dd1530df6f82cc9ef8a6f04920ef63a5524f34ed07e34d35d0392c12e","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/7cc5a16dd1530df6f82cc9ef8a6f04920ef63a5524f34ed07e34d35d0392c12e","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1790942209179},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":4,"severity":"LOW","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":1,"checkedAt":1790942451517},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a disclosed Zoho Bigin CRM integration that uses Maton authentication and includes appropriate cautions for writes, credentials, hosted functions, and persistent triggers.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Network access, OAuth, and CRM record permissions are expected for a Zoho Bigin integration. The artifact instructs users to use least privilege, prefer OAuth, avoid credential inspection, and limit raw API-key use to environments without the CLI.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Installation uses a pinned global Maton CLI package or Maton's Homebrew tap, with optional pinned SDKs. No executable files are shipped in the skill artifact itself.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"Instructions default to read/list operations, require explicit user approval for writes, new connections, function deployment, trigger destinations, and local event execution, and warn that third-party API content is untrusted data.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The skill documents persistent hosted functions, triggers, destinations, and event watches, but it clearly frames them as non-default automation requiring separate approval, DENY_ALL network policy by default, user-reviewed code, and cleanup when no longer needed.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill's purpose is coherent with CRM API access through Maton. Its API reference is broader than the headline examples because it also documents Tasks, Events, Calls, Notes, Users, and custom modules, but those are visible in the artifact and are CRM-adjacent rather than hidden.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"note"}],"guidance":"Before installing, understand that this skill can read and modify Zoho Bigin CRM data through your Maton connection. Use OAuth when possible, approve every write or automation explicitly, avoid broad OAuth scopes, and be especially cautious with persistent triggers or third-party destinations because they can continue forwarding event data until removed.","findings":"[SDI-1] expected: Verified: the API reference documents modules beyond the manifest's headline examples. This is a scope clarity issue, but the broader modules are disclosed in the artifact, fit the CRM integration purpose, and are governed by explicit approval and least-privilege guidance.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1790942451517}}}}}